  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "The plane's ownership",
      "items": [
        "workflow-plane is one npm package in the engine edition's checkout: 16 modules, one exports entry each, zero runtime dependencies.",
        "The kit carries no copy of it — npm install resolves it as a file: dependency into node_modules/workflow-plane.",
        "npm run check:port fails the moment the resolved package and the engine checkout differ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What kit apply ships",
      "items": [
        "The router runtime and the plane ship beside the router: ~/.zcode/lib/workflow plus a node_modules/workflow-plane link.",
        "What ships is derived from the package's own exports, never a written list.",
        "The launchd / systemd keepalive unit is installed in the same pass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The router",
      "items": [
        "judge.mode picks typesafe, fastino (sys1's GLiNER2.5 decide on 127.0.0.1:8400), or cascade.",
        "Every judgment is fail-open: a missing key, an error, or low confidence degrades to the default workload.",
        "The dashboard writes the roster and re-runs apply — it never writes rendered state itself."
      ]
    }
  ]
